\u244?ng b\u225?o. Tr\u432?\u7901?ng h\u7907?p h\u224?ng h\u243?a, d\u7883?ch v\u7909? thu\u7897?c di\u7879?n Nh\u224? n\u432?\u7899?c qu\u7843?n l\u253? gi\u225? th\u236? vi\u7879?c khuy\u7871?n m\u7841?i theo h\u236?nh th\u7913?c n\u224?y \u273?\u432?\u7907?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n theo quy \u273?\u7883?nh c\u7911?a Ch\u237?nh ph\u7911?.

\par 4. B\u225?n h\u224?ng, cung \u7913?ng d\u7883?ch v\u7909? c\u243? k\u232?m theo phi\u7871?u mua h\u224?ng, phi\u7871?u s\u7917? d\u7909?ng d\u7883?ch v\u7909? \u273?\u7875? kh\u225?ch h\u224?ng \u273?\u432?\u7907?c h\u432?\u7903?ng m\u7897?t hay m\u7897?t s\u7889? l\u7907?i \u237?ch nh\u7845?t \u273?\u7883?nh.
\par 5. B\u225?n h\u224?ng, cung \u7913?ng d\u7883?ch v\u7909? c\u243? k\u232?m phi\u7871?u d\u7921? thi cho kh\u225?ch h\u224?ng \u273?\u7875? ch\u7885?n ng\u432?\u7901?i trao th\u432?\u7903?ng theo th\u7875? l\u7879? v\u224? gi\u7843?i th\u432?\u7903?ng \u273?\u227? c\u244?ng b\u7889?.
\par 6. B\u225?n h\u224?ng, cung \u7913?ng d\u7883?ch v\u7909? k\u232?m theo vi\u7879?c tham d\u7921? c\u225?c ch\u432?\u417?ng tr\u236?nh mang t\u237?nh may r\u7911?i m\u224? vi\u7879?c tham gia ch\u432?\u417?ng tr\u236?nh g\u7855?n li\u7873?n v\u7899?i vi\u7879?c mua h\u224?ng h\u243?a, d\u7883?ch v\u7909? v\u224? vi\u7879?c tr
\u250?ng th\u432?\u7903?ng d\u7921?a tr\u234?n s\u7921? may m\u7855?n c\u7911?a ng\u432?\u7901?i tham gia theo th\u7875? l\u7879? v\u224? gi\u7843?i th\u432?\u7903?ng \u273?\u227? c\u244?ng b\u7889?.
\par 7. T\u7893? ch\u7913?c ch\u432?\u417?ng tr\u236?nh kh\u225?ch h\u224?ng th\u432?\u7901?ng xuy\u234?n, theo \u273?\u243? vi\u7879?c t\u7863?ng th\u432?\u7903?ng cho kh\u225?ch h\u224?ng c\u259?n c\u7913? tr\u234?n s\u7889? l\u432?\u7907?ng ho\u7863?c tr\u7883? gi\u225? mua h\u224?ng h\u243?a, d\u7883?ch v\u7909? m\u224? kh\u225?ch h
\u224?ng th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n \u273?\u432?\u7907?c th\u7875? hi\u7879?n d\u432?\u7899?i h\u236?nh th\u7913?c th\u7867? kh\u225?ch h\u224?ng, phi\u7871?u ghi nh\u7853?n s\u7921? mua h\u224?ng ho\u225?, d\u7883?ch v\u7909? ho\u7863?c c\u225?c h\u236?nh th\u7913?c kh\u225?c.
\par 8. T\u7893? ch\u7913?c cho kh\u225?ch h\u224?ng tham gia c\u225?c ch\u432?\u417?ng tr\u236?nh v\u259?n h\u243?a, ngh\u7879? thu\u7853?t, gi\u7843?i tr\u237? v\u224? c\u225?c s\u7921? ki\u7879?n kh\u225?c v\u236? m\u7909?c \u273?\u237?ch khuy\u7871?n m\u7841?i. 
\par 9. C\u225?c h\u236?nh th\u7913?c khuy\u7871?n m\u7841?i kh\u225?c n\u7871?u \u273?\u432?\u7907?c c\u417? quan qu\u7843?n l\u253? nh\u224? n\u432?\u7899?c v\u7873? th\u432?\u417?ng m\u7841?i ch\u7845?p thu\u7853?n.
