i h\u224?ng ho\u225? khi c\u243? s\u7921? ch\u7845?p thu\u7853?n c\u7911?a b\u234?n cho thu\u234?. B\u234?n thu\u234? ph\u7843?i ch\u7883?u tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m v\u7873? h\u224?ng ho\u225? cho thu\u234? l\u7841?i tr\u7915? tr\u432?\u7901?ng h\u7907?p c\u243? tho\u7843? thu\u7853?n kh\u225?c v\u7899?i b\u234?n cho thu\u234?.

\par 2. Trong tr\u432?\u7901?ng h\u7907?p b\u234?n thu\u234? cho thu\u234? l\u7841?i h\u224?ng h\u243?a cho thu\u234? m\u224? kh\u244?ng c\u243? s\u7921? ch\u7845?p thu\u7853?n c\u7911?a b\u234?n cho thu\u234? th\u236? b\u234?n cho thu\u234? c\u243? quy\u7873?n h\u7911?y h\u7907?p \u273?\u7891?ng cho thu\u234?. Ng\u432?\u7901?i thu
\u234? l\u7841?i ph\u7843?i c\u243? tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m tr\u7843? l\u7841?i ngay h\u224?ng h\u243?a cho b\u234?n cho thu\u234?.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \loch\af31\dbch\af0\hich\f31 \u272?}{\i0 i\u7873?u 282.}{ L\u7907?i \u237?ch ph\u225?
