\par 2. C\u225?c b\u234?n c\u243? quy\u7873?n \u273?\u242?i l\u7841?i l\u7907?i \u237?ch do vi\u7879?c \u273?\u227? th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n ph\u7847?n ngh\u297?a v\u7909? c\u7911?a m\u236?nh theo h\u7907?p \u273?\u7891?ng; n\u7871?u c\u225?c b\u234?n \u273?\u7873?u c\u243? ngh\u297?a v\u7909? ho\u224?n tr\u7843? th\u236? ngh\u297?a v\u7909? c\u7911?
a h\u7885? ph\u7843?i \u273?\u432?\u7907?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n \u273?\u7891?ng th\u7901?i; tr\u432?\u7901?ng h\u7907?p kh\u244?ng th\u7875? ho\u224?n tr\u7843? b\u7857?ng ch\u237?nh l\u7907?i \u237?ch \u273?\u227? nh\u7853?n th\u236? b\u234?n c\u243? ngh\u297?a v\u7909? ph\u7843?i ho\u224?n tr\u7843? b\u7857?ng ti\u7873?n.
\par }{\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 3. B\u234?n b\u7883? vi ph\u7841?m c\u243? quy\u7873?n y\u234?u c\u7847?u b\u7891?i th\u432?\u7901?ng thi\u7879?t h\u7841?i theo quy \u273?\u7883?nh c\u7911?a Lu\u7853?t n\u224?y.
