\u7875?m \u273? kho\u7843?n 1 \u272?i\u7873?u 237 c\u7911?a Lu\u7853?t n\u224?y, th\u7901?i h\u7841?n khi\u7871?u n\u7841?i do c\u225?c b\u234?n th\u7887?a thu\u7853?n, n\u7871?u c\u225?c b\u234?n kh\u244?ng c\u243? tho\u7843? thu\u7853?n th\u236? th\u7901?i h\u7841?n khi\u7871?u n\u7841?i \u273?\u432?\u7907?c quy \u273?\u7883?nh nh\u432?
 sau:
\par }{\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 1. Ba th\u225?ng, k\u7875? t\u7915? ng\u224?y giao h\u224?ng \u273?\u7889?i v\u7899?i khi\u7871?u n\u7841?i v\u7873? s\u7889? l\u432?\u7907?ng h\u224?ng ho\u225?;
\par }{\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 2. S\u225?u th\u225?ng, k\u7875? t\u7915? ng\u224?y giao h\u224?ng \u273?\u7889?i v\u7899?i khi\u7871?u n\u7841?i v\u7873? ch\u7845?t l\u432?\u7907?ng h\u224?ng ho\u225?; trong tr\u432?\u7901?ng h\u7907?p h\u224?ng ho\u225? c\u243? b\u7843?o h\u224?nh th\u236? th\u7901?i h\u7841?n khi\u7871?
u n\u7841?i l\u224? ba th\u225?ng, k\u7875? t\u7915? ng\u224?y h\u7871?t th\u7901?i h\u7841?n b\u7843?o h\u224?nh;
\par 3. Ch\u237?n th\u225?ng, k\u7875? t\u7915? ng\u224?y b\u234?n vi ph\u7841?m ph\u7843?i ho\u224?n th\u224?nh ngh\u297?a v\u7909? theo h\u7907?p \u273?\u7891?ng ho\u7863?c trong tr\u432?\u7901?ng h\u7907?p c\u243? b\u7843?o h\u224?nh th\u236? k\u7875? t\u7915? ng\u224?y h\u7871?t th\u7901?i h\u7841?n b\u7843?o h\u224?nh \u273?\u7889?i v
\u7899?i khi\u7871?u n\u7841?i v\u7873? c\u225?c vi ph\u7841?m kh\u225?c.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \loch\af31\dbch\af0\hich\f31 \u272?}{\i0 i\u7873?u 319.}{ Th\u7901?i hi\u7879?u kh\u7903?
i ki\u7879?n
